OL,3,GNEWSATeacher banned over relationship
OL,4,Awith sex offender
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher has been banned after failing
OL,7,Fto disclose a relationship with a sex
OL,8,Foffender.
OL,10,FCarolyn Corner taught English at
OL,11,FFerryhill School, in County Durham,
OL,12,Funtil she resigned in August 2024.
OL,14,FA professional conduct panel of the
OL,15,FTeaching Regulation Agency (TRA) said
OL,16,FCorner failed to inform her school the
OL,17,Findividual had been convicted in 2021
OL,18,Fof sexual offences against a child and
OL,19,Fsentenced to five years' imprisonment
OL,20,Fand did not disclose she intended to
OL,21,Fmove in with him after his release in
OL,22,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
